nodes.definition_ro:
Limba straina este orice limba cunoscuta (utilizata) de catre respondent, alta decat cea pe care acesta o considera a fi limba materna. Persoanele avand alta limba materna decat limba romana au putut-o declara pe acesta din urma ca fiind limba straina cunoscuta.
Limbile utilizate inseamna toate limbile pe care o persoana le poate intelege sau vorbi, chiar daca foarte putin. 
Competentele lingvistice intr-o limba straina sunt determinate pe baza evaluarii proprii de catre respondent a nivelului de cunoastere a acesteia:
- Utilizator elementar se refera la faptul ca persoana poate sa comunice intr-o conversatie simpla, sa formuleze intrebari simple pe teme cunoscute sau de necesitate imediata si sa raspunda la asemenea intrebari; 
- Utilizator intermediar se refera la faptul ca persoana poate sa participe fara pregatire prealabila la o conversatie pe teme familiare, de interes personal sau referitoare la viata cotidiana (de ex. familie, petrecerea timpului liber, calatoriile, activitatea profesionala si evenimentele curente);
- Utilizator avansat se refera la faptul ca persoana poate sa se exprime fluent si spontan, si sa utilizeze limba in mod flexibil si eficient in relatiile sociale si in scopuri profesionale.

nodes.definition_en:
Foreign language is any language known (used) by the respondent, other than the one he considers to be his mother tongue. People with a mother tongue other than Romanian could declare the latter as a known foreign language.
Languages used means all languages that a person can understand or speak, even if very little.
Linguistic skills in a foreign language are determined based on the respondent's own assessment of the level of knowledge of it:
- Basic user refers to the fact that the person can communicate in a simple conversation, formulate simple questions on known topics or of immediate need and answer such questions;
- Intermediate user refers to the fact that the person can participate without prior preparation in a conversation on familiar topics, of personal interest or related to everyday life (e.g. family, leisure, travel, professional activity and current events) ;
-Advanced user refers to the fact that the person can express himself fluently and spontaneously, and use the language flexibly and effectively in social relations and for professional purposes.
